{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/b37fb6dc5b8a70dc4b2140598fec0c5b.avif?t=1771098263\" width=1560 height=211 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>math is hard</strong>\u00a0is a sokoban style math puzzler, where you must create valid math equations and solve clever, logic-driven puzzles!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/f855af2d9de8168202350a571af7481f.poster.avif?t=1771098263\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/f855af2d9de8168202350a571af7481f.webm?t=1771098263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/f855af2d9de8168202350a571af7481f.mp4?t=1771098263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level challenges you to reach a <strong>target value</strong> by arranging numbers and operators in the correct order.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/9661d23a9388d21607f7467a9d5f39ad.avif?t=1771098263\" width=1560 height=211 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenging puzzles using different combinations of operations\u00a0\u2014 \u2795\u2796\u2716\ufe0f\u2797\u00a0\u2014 alongside special blocks that twist the rules of the level!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/f4ce12ed2e40dcbf0f0caf575df9d17e.poster.avif?t=1771098263\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/f4ce12ed2e40dcbf0f0caf575df9d17e.webm?t=1771098263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/f4ce12ed2e40dcbf0f0caf575df9d17e.mp4?t=1771098263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/9d28f5c960957e43f9ba55cc16c3be49.avif?t=1771098263\" width=1560 height=211 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't worry</strong> this game math is not <i><strong>that</strong></i> hard! Push your way to the correct value and prove that math <i>can</i> be fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/d6484c659131445b98ccd9fe555d7b8a.poster.avif?t=1771098263\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/d6484c659131445b98ccd9fe555d7b8a.webm?t=1771098263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/d6484c659131445b98ccd9fe555d7b8a.mp4?t=1771098263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was originally created for and won the MiniJam 183: Calculations.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739920?t=1771098263","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739920?t=